<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about TechnoRaise, an English-language technology publication focused on clear thinking and practical perspectives.">
  <section class="prose-hero section-wrap">
    <span class="section-kicker">WHY WE'RE HERE</span>
    <h1>Technology deserves more than <em>noise.</em></h1>
    <p class="prose-intro">TechnoRaise is an English-language publication exploring the ideas, tools, and decisions shaping our digital world.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="prose-layout section-wrap">
    <aside class="prose-aside"><span>OUR PURPOSE</span><b>Make the complex<br />more useful.</b></aside>
    <div class="prose-body">
      <h2>Clarity in a world of constant change.</h2>
      <p>New technologies arrive every day. The harder work is understanding what matters, how things work, and where they can make a meaningful difference.</p>
      <p>TechnoRaise brings together practical explainers, thoughtful analysis, and technology coverage across software development, artificial intelligence, digital solutions, digital transformation, and industry news.</p>
      <h2>Curiosity with context.</h2>
      <p>We aim to make technical subjects approachable without making them shallow. Our editorial direction values accuracy, useful context, clear explanations, and a healthy distinction between evidence and opinion.</p>
      <h2>An independent editorial project.</h2>
      <p>This site is being established as a focused technology publication. Specific publisher, author, and organizational details will be added when they are verified and ready to be shared.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>